      "writtenOn": "2020-05-30T00:07:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it may be useful in those cases where we\u0027re looking for a very particular error. I also keep or\u0027ing in return values so I\u0027m not sure how useful it is to return rv as is. Multiple i2c transactions could fail for different reasons.",
